# Copy to .env and edit if you want to override a default:  cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored. The backend (pydantic-settings) reads it from the working
# directory on startup. For a normal run none of this is required — the defaults
# are fine.
#
# The dashboard ships as a desktop app (docs/adr/0016). The old VPS deployment
# and its WEB_BIND / API_BIND / TZ / TUNNEL_TOKEN knobs are retired — see the
# "old VPS deployment" appendix in deploy/README.md for that history.

# --- Data directory ---------------------------------------------------------
# Where the parquet cache, the SQLite app DB, the DuckDB file, the archived
# Yahoo/consensus pulls, and the weekly snapshots live. Defaults to ./data for a
# source checkout; the desktop app points it at a per-user app-data directory.
# DEADPARROTS_DATA_DIR=data

# --- Yahoo assisted pull (desktop app) ------------------------------------
# The desktop shell signs into Yahoo in an embedded browser and exposes a
# loopback endpoint that scrapes one page per call. The shell sets this itself;
# leave it unset for a bare backend and POST /api/yahoo/pull answers 503.
# DEADPARROTS_YAHOO_EXTRACTOR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765/scrape
# DEADPARROTS_YAHOO_EXTRACTOR_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=90

# --- Catch-up on launch ---------------------------------------------------
# On startup, re-run any scheduled pull whose window passed while the app was
# closed (nflverse refresh, consensus re-score, news poll, and the weekly
# snapshot for a finished-but-unsnapshotted week). Set to false to disable.
# DEADPARROTS_CATCHUP_ON_LAUNCH=true

# --- nflverse pull failure alert ----------------------------------------------
# Until DEADPARROTS_SMTP_HOST is set, a failed weekly nflverse pull is logged at
# ERROR, not emailed. For Gmail use an App Password (Account -> Security -> App
# passwords), not your normal password.
# DEADPARROTS_SMTP_HOST=
# DEADPARROTS_SMTP_PORT=587
# DEADPARROTS_SMTP_USERNAME=
# DEADPARROTS_SMTP_PASSWORD=
# DEADPARROTS_SMTP_STARTTLS=true
# DEADPARROTS_ALERT_EMAIL_TO=johncyrboston@gmail.com
# DEADPARROTS_ALERT_EMAIL_FROM=deadparrots-dashboard@localhost
